			</p.DefaultValue>
			<p.TypeDefinitionTargets xmlns="http://www.ni.com/PanelCommon">
				<TypeDefinitionTarget TargetName="NI:G\ Core:Error:Error\.gtype" />
			</p.TypeDefinitionTargets>
			<p.UserDescription xmlns="http://www.ni.com/PlatformFramework">&lt;B&gt;error in&lt;/B&gt; can accept error information wired from VIs previously called. Use this information to decide if any functionality should be bypassed in the event of errors from other VIs.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Right-click the &lt;B&gt;error in&lt;/B&gt; control on the front panel and select &lt;B&gt;Explain Error&lt;/B&gt; or &lt;B&gt;Explain Warning&lt;/B&gt; from the shortcut menu for more information about the error.</p.UserDescription>
